{"type":"json_object","message":"The change in the product warranty reserve is explained by 2006 activity: pretax warranty charges add $4 million, cash warranty outlays reduce it by $5 million, and assumed warranty obligations from acquisitions add $7 million. Net change = charges - cash outlays + assumed obligations. Sources: q12n3 (2006 pretax charges, $4M), q13n0 (2006 cash outlays, $5M), q14n0 (assumed warranty obligations, $7M).","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"charges - cash_outlays + assumed_obligations","variables":{"charges":{"value":4,"source":"source:q12n3","unit":"USD_million"},"cash_outlays":{"value":5,"source":"source:q13n0","unit":"USD_million"},"assumed_obligations":{"value":7,"source":"source:q14n0","unit":"USD_million"}}}}